nce","desc":"Expected goals conceded per match: the value of the chances the opponent had. Lower is better."},{"key":"xg_diff","label":"xG difference","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"xG for minus xG against per match: the underlying margin between a team and its opponents. Higher is better."},{"key":"goals_for","label":"Goals for","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Goals scored per match."},{"key":"goals_against","label":"Goals against","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"Goals conceded per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"finishing","label":"Finishing","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Goals scored minus expected goals, per match: positive means the team has scored more than its chances were worth."},{"key":"keeping","label":"Keeping","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Expected goals against minus goals conceded, per match: positive means the team has conceded less than the chances it allowed were worth. Higher is better."},{"key":"xpts_per_match","label":"xPts per match","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Expected points per match: for each match, the points a team would earn on average if its xG and its opponent's xG were replayed as Poisson goal counts. Higher is better."},{"key":"luck","label":"Luck","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Points minus expected points, per match: how far results have run ahead of (positive) or behind (negative) the underlying performance."},{"key":"possession","label":"Possession","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Share of the ball, averaged over matches, as a percentage."},{"key":"field_tilt","label":"Field tilt","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Touches in the opponent's box as a percentage of touches in both boxes (own box touches divided by own plus opponent box touches). Above 50 means the team spends more of the game in the dangerous end than its opponents do."},{"key":"ppda","label":"PPDA",